and I'd be done with it. And then when it went through 77 and 78, I thought, well, maybe it has another six month ago. And then it went through 78 and 79. And here we are after so many decades and it's still persists. I can't believe it. I mean there is no doubt that I will go out into the street today and I will see half a dozen versions of it. If you go down to Chinatown, every building, every street, every side of a wall is covered with I love New York.
