the NY, and the cultural reference still comes across. In fact, even New York State is doing this. You can now find the official spin-off logos, I peed the New York, and I beach-balled New York. It is now easier than ever before in human history to take something and change it just enough to make it your own. Imitating and altering and remixing has always been the way that humans engage with the world, but there's a limit here.
